*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0021
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-08-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-12-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 362
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0021.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> STUDENT INDICATOR Y/N
    05 STUDENT-FLAG       PIC X.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 CLNT-AGE           PIC 9(3).
    05 RUN-DATE           PIC 9(8).
    05 RUN-DATE-R REDEFINES RUN-DATE.
       10 RUN-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 RUN-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 RUN-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> FEE WAIVER INDICATOR
    05 FEE-WAIVER-FLG     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 SVC-CHARGE         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 2200-CONCESSIONS
    DISPLAY "FEE-WAIVER-FLG=" FEE-WAIVER-FLG
    DISPLAY "SVC-CHARGE=" SVC-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
2200-CONCESSIONS.
    *> STUDENT FEE WAIVER
    IF STUDENT-FLAG = 'Y' AND CLNT-AGE < 26
        MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVER-FLG
        MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
    *> SENIOR FEE WAIVER
    ELSE IF CLNT-AGE >= 65
        MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVER-FLG
        MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
    ELSE
        MOVE 9 TO SVC-CHARGE
    END-IF
    END-IF.
